# The fix moves the whole `| render` line, keeping the layout.
mode: syntax
---- query
'orders.csv'
| summarize total = sum(amount) by customerId
| render barchart with (title = "Totals")
| sort by total desc
---- expected
PROGRAM@0..122
  PIPELINE@0..121
    LITERAL@0..12
      STRING@0..12 "'orders.csv'"
    WHITESPACE@12..13 "\n"
    PIPE@13..14 "|"
    WHITESPACE@14..15 " "
    SUMMARIZE_OP@15..58
      IDENT@15..24 "summarize"
      WHITESPACE@24..25 " "
      NAMED_EXPR@25..44
        NAME@25..30
          IDENT@25..30 "total"
        WHITESPACE@30..31 " "
        EQ@31..32 "="
        WHITESPACE@32..33 " "
        CALL_EXPR@33..44
          NAME_REF@33..36
            IDENT@33..36 "sum"
          ARG_LIST@36..44
            L_PAREN@36..37 "("
            NAME_REF@37..43
              IDENT@37..43 "amount"
            R_PAREN@43..44 ")"
      WHITESPACE@44..45 " "
      BY_CLAUSE@45..58
        IDENT@45..47 "by"
        WHITESPACE@47..48 " "
        NAMED_EXPR@48..58
          NAME_REF@48..58
            IDENT@48..58 "customerId"
    WHITESPACE@58..59 "\n"
    PIPE@59..60 "|"
    WHITESPACE@60..61 " "
    RENDER_OP@61..100
      IDENT@61..67 "render"
      WHITESPACE@67..68 " "
      IDENT@68..76 "barchart"
      WHITESPACE@76..77 " "
      RENDER_PROPS@77..100
        IDENT@77..81 "with"
        WHITESPACE@81..82 " "
        L_PAREN@82..83 "("
        RENDER_PROP@83..99
          NAME@83..88
            IDENT@83..88 "title"
          WHITESPACE@88..89 " "
          EQ@89..90 "="
          WHITESPACE@90..91 " "
          LITERAL@91..99
            STRING@91..99 "\"Totals\""
        R_PAREN@99..100 ")"
    WHITESPACE@100..101 "\n"
    PIPE@101..102 "|"
    WHITESPACE@102..103 " "
    SORT_OP@103..121
      IDENT@103..107 "sort"
      WHITESPACE@107..108 " "
      IDENT@108..110 "by"
      WHITESPACE@110..111 " "
      SORT_KEY@111..121
        NAME_REF@111..116
          IDENT@111..116 "total"
        WHITESPACE@116..117 " "
        IDENT@117..121 "desc"
  WHITESPACE@121..122 "\n"

error[DS0120]: `render` must be the last operator
  --> query:3:3
  |
3 | | render barchart with (title = "Totals")
  |   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
4 | | sort by total desc
  |   ------------------ this operator comes after `render`
  |
  = help: move `render barchart with (title = "Totals")` to the end of the query

with the machine-applicable fixes applied:
    'orders.csv'
    | summarize total = sum(amount) by customerId
    | sort by total desc
    | render barchart with (title = "Totals")
which parses without errors
